      <title>Meet the Mason Nation: John Forgy</title>
      <link>https://www.gmu.edu/news/2026-03/meet-mason-nation-john-forgy</link>
      <description>We rely on a countless number of signs each day, whether we are driving, walking through a neighborhood, shopping at the grocery store, or going from building to building on campus. John Forgy, environmental graphic designer and sign program manager at George Mason University, creates the wayfinding systems that guide students, faculty, staff, and visitors across the university’s campuses and sites.</description>
